 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "children-of-silentown-121016@patch-2023-03-13",
   "gameId": "children-of-silentown-121016",
   "displayName": "Chapters Patch is live",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-13T16:19:06.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello there!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It’s been roughly two months since release, how time flies! 🦋",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are glad to see so many of you enjoying our work - many thanks y’all for the support! 🌞",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "On our side, we have been hard at work to introduce some much needed QoL improvements for after you complete the game for the first time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now, upon completing the game once you now unlock (on the same save):",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chapter select - to play any chapter you like! (but be careful - if you want a specific best friend to appear you-know-where, you have to play the game from Chapter 1).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minigame skip - in case you don’t want to solve them again",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Persistent collectibles and last song notes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve also added a fix for many small issues you have reported so far:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(BLOCKING) Occasional issue in the Forest with the rope puzzles in Chapter 5;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(Soft-BLOCKING) Carillon being unresponsive after singing to it in Chapter 4;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some audios of the game were not affected by game options (i.e. cutscenes, some SFX);",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Mother's minigame was giving \"success\" when exiting the minigame without solving it in the Forest;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor updates/fixes to Italian and Turkish localizations;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Save\" and \"Load\" buttons properly localized;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fire sound active with no fire visible in Chapter 2;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Broken animation in the climbing puzzle in the Forest (when using the key on the stone column);",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Broken animation during the monster reveal scene in Chapter 5;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A few broken character animations during the game;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bench D2 missing \"cogs\" icon when the playground is interactable;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lucy was walking through walls during the “dark village” scene in Chapter 4.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That’s all from us - thank you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Elfs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
