  {
   "id": "children-of-silentown-121016@major-2022-10-18",
   "gameId": "children-of-silentown-121016",
   "displayName": "Update time!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-10-18T06:00:38.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🔥 Heya all! 🎃",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It’s been a long time since we had something to post - but right now, we have something great to share and we want you to take part in our joy:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) The PC version of the game went \"Gold\", a.k.a. it’s complete!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Obviously, there are still few more things that need to be prepared for a bombastic release - so it will not be today or tomorrow… but when the time is right, please look forward to an announcement from our publisher Daedalic!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) The Prologue to the game recently has passed the 1000 reviews!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This is already a great achievement in itself, but especially since there is a whole game to follow up - Many thanks to everyone that played the prologue and left their feedback, it’s lovely to see so many of you enjoying it - this is not just heartwarming but really helps a lot for the upcoming release of Children of Silentown. ❤️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Spooky time is upon us!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now, we will not be able to release during October (even if we tried 😭) but please, enjoy the spooky holidays to the fullest - the waiting will pay off eventually - that is for sure!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That’s all for now, may the spook be with you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Elfs (& Daedalic Entertainment)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
